        "notes": "Players can cause destruction across numerous levels both on foot and in a vehicle. Most combat is with other hostile NPCs and vehicles, but both hostile and non-hostile human-scale characters can be encountered and subsequently crushed by the player. Blood splats that human-scale characters leave behind can be turned off by toggling the DISABLE GRAPHIC CONTENT option in SETTINGS > GENERAL. \r\n\r\nIn-game text entries may not be fit for those under the age of 16, as some contain descriptions of violent acts, crude humor and horror."
